From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 18:22:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(streams): hide titles without playable streams, link
 FlixMomo to IMDb, serve source links under IMDb ids

- 4.6f: catalog rows only list custom-id titles whose stream file has a playable link
  (IMDb-linked titles always stay). Ends 'None of them returned streams' errors.
  Set HIDE_UNPLAYABLE=0 to turn off.
- 4.6e: source links resolved for a custom id are also written to stream/movie/tt*.json
- imdb.js: exact TMDB-id -> IMDb mapping (FlixMomo) with its own lookup allowance
- per-source rows with no playable titles are dropped (no empty folders in collections)
- normalizeCanonicalSlug: keep title numbers before an episode tag; fixes the failing
  unit test that stopped the GitHub Actions sync

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01S9Rg85UjiKT24RqsrySC11
